134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 458 0 R
/ActualText (- The "Scope" of your QMS records the areas within your organisation which are covered by your QMS, and also identifies any which are not to be included. This scope may include specific details such as the products and services being provided and the locations from which quality-related activities are delivered. The scope will be used by your assessment organisation and documented on any ISO 9001 certificate which they subsequently issue to you.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
