150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 468 0 R
/ActualText (- If your organisation uses technical equipment to assess product or service conformance \(e.g., scales, metres or gauges\), ISO 9001 requires you to uniquely identify each piece of equipment and ensure that each is properly calibrated or verified at specified intervals to ensure its ongoing accuracy. Furthermore, such equipment must be protected to prevent it from being poorly adjusted or damaged, which would then effect the conformity of the product or service being measured. Documents and records to demonstrate the proper management of measuring equipment and technologies should be kept.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
