179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 486 0 R
/ActualText (- ISO 9001 specifies a set of characteristics to help your organisation manage the policies and procedures \(a\) required by the standard, and \(b\) created by your organisation to support quality objectives. This includes how documents are identified, reviewed, approved, made available to personnel, retained and disposed of, amongst others. Similar considerations will be needed for the records which are produced to demonstrate that quality-related activities have been undertaken.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
