/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 488 0 R
/ActualText (- Your organisation will need to conduct reviews to determine whether it can meet customer requirements for specified products or services. ISO 9001 requires you to keep records of such reviews to demonstrate that they have taken place, as well as clearly recording any newly identified requirements for such products or services.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
