200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 500 0 R
/ActualText (- As you refine your design and development activities, it will be important to consider controls which will help you to \(a\) define the results that are to be achieved, \(b\) ensure that regular reviews are being conducted, \(c\) ensure that design and development actual outputs meet specific input requirements, \(d\) validation checks are in place to ensure that products or services are suitable for their intended use, and \(e\) take action on any problems identified during reviews or checks. Documents and records of these "control activities" should be kept.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
