227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 518 0 R
/ActualText (- A formal approach to the evaluation of a supplier's capabilities should be undertaken before they are permitted to support any part of your organisation's quality activities for designing, manufacturing, delivering or supporting its products or services. You need to monitor ongoing supplier performance on a regular basis, and be prepared to review decisions if necessary. The ISO 9001 standard requires you to document how you evaluate and select your suppliers, including any resultnig decisions and actions.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 519 0 R
/ActualText (8.5.1)
