/P 520 0 R
/ActualText (Documented characteristics of products or services)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 520 0 R
/ActualText (- To ensure that production or provision can proceed as planned, ISO 9001 requires these to take place under controlled conditions. This includes, for example, the availability of \(a\) documented information, \(b\) monitoring and/measuring processes and equipment \(c\) appropriate infrastructure and safe operating environments, \(d\) competent, experienced and qualified personnel, \(e\) validation of the products produced or services provided and \(f\) associated release or delivery activities.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
