242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 528 0 R
/ActualText (- If your organisation takes control of property \(including data\) belonging to your customers or other third-party organisations during the process of producing your products or services, then you will want to properly identify and record details of such property and ensure that it is properly managed and protected. This applies to property which is provided \(a\) for incorporation within your products or services, as well as \(b\) that which is to be returned to its owner at an agreed future date.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
