245 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 530 0 R
/ActualText (- During the production of goods or the provision of services, there may be circumstances where changes may be identified as needed to ensure that your organisation can continue to meet product/service specifications, contractual requirements or other external factors. As such changes are identified, they need to be recorded, and then passed to suitable persons to undertake a proper assessment and consideration for authorisation \(or rejection\).)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [11]
>>
