/P 540 0 R
/ActualText (activities)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
261 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 540 0 R
/ActualText (- Component activities within your QMS need to be capable of being monitored and measured, so you will be able to understand whether your organisation's efforts are effective and supporting the achievement of its quality objectives. This document should record the various quality-related activities that are being undertaken, and determine how they can be managed and reviewed to ensure that they remain both effective and relevant to the QMS.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
