endobj
273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 548 0 R
/ActualText (- On a regular basis, your organisation should reach out to its customers \(or a subset of them\) to assess their level of satisfaction with your organisation's performance, and specifically to check whether your products/services are meeting their expectations. This activity could be conducted by questionnaire, phone interview, during meetings with customers, or by assessing praise or complaints received. Records of this activity will be useful inputs to many other parts of your QMS.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
