276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 550 0 R
/ActualText (- Each ISO management system standard requires an organisation to plan for and undertake regular internal audits, to ensure that it is regularly checking how well it is performing. Your organisation's internal audit activities for your QMS should be planned in advance. The results of each internal audit activity should be documented and reviewed, such that any corrective actions or improvement opportunities can be identified, recorded and implemented as required.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
